{
  "id": "silver_counter",
  "chapter": 1,
  "title": { "ru": "Серебряный Прилавок", "en": "The Silver Counter" },
  "tags": ["death", "ceremony", "osoka"],
  "entry": "queue_entry",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "kind": "branch",
      "id": "queue_entry",
      "branches": [{ "when": { "kind": "deaths", "op": "gte", "value": 1 }, "to": "queue_repeat" }],
      "fallback": "queue_hall"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "queue_hall",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Стойка длинная, серебряная, потемневшая по краю от локтей. Стен нет — свет просто кончается на четвёртом шаге в сторону, как в ломбарде под вечер, когда лампы гасят с дальнего конца.",
        "en": "The counter is long and silver, darkened along the edge by elbows. There are no walls — the light simply ends four paces to either side, the way it does in a pawnshop towards evening, when the lamps are put out from the far end."
      },
      "keywords": [{ "match": { "ru": "Стойка", "en": "counter" }, "tone": "lore" }],
      "next": "queue_people"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "queue_people",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Очередь стоит с лотами наготове. Купец впереди держит свою память двумя руками снизу, как торт, и боится наклонить.",
        "en": "The queue stands with its lots ready. The merchant ahead holds his memory from underneath with both hands, like a cake, and is afraid to tilt it."
      },
      "next": "queue_dead"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "queue_dead",
      "speaker": "mertvyy_v_ocheredi",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Я всё принёс. Всё до последнего. Скажите, этого хватит? У меня больше нет, и не будет уже.",
        "en": "I brought everything. Everything, down to the last of it. Tell me, will it be enough? I have nothing else, and there will not be anything else."
      },
      "mood": "afraid",
      "next": "queue_murmur"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "queue_murmur",
      "speaker": "ochered",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Хватит, хватит, всем хватало. Не задерживайте, тут за вами люди.",
        "en": "It will be enough, it always has been. Do not hold things up, there are people behind you."
      },
      "next": "queue_turn"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "queue_turn",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Для каждого в этой очереди сегодня худший день. Для тебя это вторник, и ты единственный, кто помнит, что уже стоял тут вчера ровно так же.",
        "en": "For everyone in this queue today is the worst day there is. For you it is a Tuesday, and you are the only one who remembers standing here exactly like this before."
      },
      "next": "book_open"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "queue_repeat",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Ты встаёшь куда надо сам, не считая шагов. Очередь сменилась целиком, а лоты держат так же: двумя руками, снизу.",
        "en": "You take your place yourself, without counting the steps. The queue has changed entirely, but the lots are held the same way: with both hands, from underneath."
      },
      "next": "queue_repeat_dead"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "queue_repeat_dead",
      "speaker": "mertvyy_v_ocheredi",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Вы тут не первый раз, я вижу. Скажите, а что дальше-то? Мне сегодня в первый.",
        "en": "You have been here before, I can see it. Tell me, what comes after? Today is my first time."
      },
      "mood": "afraid",
      "next": "queue_repeat_turn"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "queue_repeat_turn",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Ответить нечего: за прилавком ты бывал, за прилавок не проходил ни разу. Очередь двигается на два человека, и один из них — ты.",
        "en": "There is nothing to answer: you have been at the counter, you have never been past it. The queue moves on by two people, and one of them is you."
      },
      "next": "book_open"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "book_open",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Осока кладёт перед собой вкладную книгу и открывает на твоей странице сразу, не ища. Страница пустая, и следующая тоже.",
        "en": "Osoka lays the deposit book in front of her and opens it at your page at once, without searching. The page is blank, and so is the next one."
      },
      "next": "osoka_pages"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "osoka_pages",
      "speaker": "osoka",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Вкладная книга. Гасить нечем.",
        "en": "Deposit book. Nothing to settle with."
      },
      "next": "book_blank"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "id": "book_blank",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Она проводит пальцем сверху вниз по обеим страницам, как ведут по строкам, — по привычке, а не по надобности. Строк там нет уже очень давно.",
        "en": "She runs a finger down both pages the way one runs it down lines of writing — out of habit, not necessity. There have been no lines there for a very long time."
      },
      "next": "osoka_rule"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "osoka_rule",
      "speaker": "osoka",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Не расплатился — не прошёл. Правило старше прилавка.",
        "en": "No payment, no passage. That rule predates the counter."
      },
      "keywords": [
        {
          "match": { "ru": "Не расплатился — не прошёл", "en": "No payment, no passage" },
          "tone": "lore"
        }
      ],
      "next": "rule_router"
    },
    {
      "kind": "branch",
      "id": "rule_router",
      "branches": [{ "when": { "kind": "flag", "flag": "contract_read" }, "to": "osoka_seven" }],
      "fallback": "osoka_plain_clause"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "osoka_seven",
      "speaker": "osoka",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Списанию не подлежите. Пункт седьмой.",
        "en": "Not subject to write-off. Item seven."
      },
      "keywords": [{ "match": { "ru": "Пункт седьмой", "en": "Item seven" }, "tone": "memory" }],
      "next": "osoka_send"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "osoka_plain_clause",
      "speaker": "osoka",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Списанию не подлежите. По договору.",
        "en": "Not subject to write-off. Per contract."
      },
      "next": "osoka_send"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "id": "osoka_send",
      "speaker": "osoka",
      "text": {
        "ru": "Направляетесь на доработку. Срок — сутки.",
        "en": "You are returned for completion. Term: one day."
      },
      "next": "counter_choice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "choice",
      "id": "counter_choice",
      "prompt": {
        "ru": "Перо у неё уже поднято над следующей строкой.",
        "en": "Her pen is already raised over the next line."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "beyond",
          "text": { "ru": "Что там, за прилавком?", "en": "What is there, past the counter?" },
          "fallback": true,
          "to": "r_beyond"
        },
        {
          "id": "signature",
          "text": { "ru": "Кто подписывал мой договор?", "en": "Who signed my contract?" },
          "fallback": true,
          "to": "r_signature"
        },
        {
          "id": "silence",
          "text": { "ru": "Промолчать.", "en": "Say nothing." },
          "fallback": true,
          "to": "r_silent"
        },
        {
          "id": "count",
          "conditions": { "kind": "axis", "axis": "reason_obsession", "op": "lte", "value": -20 },
          "text": {
            "ru": "Сколько человек прошло сегодня до меня?",
            "en": "How many went through ahead of me?"
          },
          "to": "r_count",
          "priority": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "mercy",
          "conditions": { "kind": "axis", "axis": "mercy_cruelty", "op": "gte", "value": 20 },
          "text": {
            "ru": "Пропустите тех, кто плачет, вперёд.",
            "en": "Let the ones who are crying go first."
          },
          "to": "r_mercy",
          "priority": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "punkt",
          "conditions": { "kind": "flag", "flag": "contract_read" },
          "text": { "ru": "Пункт седьмой писан моей рукой.", "en": "Item seven is in my own hand." },
          "to": "r_signature",
          "priority": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "cold",
          "conditions": { "kind": "axis", "axis": "mercy_cruelty", "op": "lte", "value": -30 },
          "text": { "ru": "Оформляйте. Мне некогда.", "en": "Process it. I am short of time." },
          "to": "r_silent",
          "priority": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "branch",
      "id": "r_beyond",
      "branches": [
        { "when": { "kind": "deaths", "op": "gte", "value": 1 }, "to": "r_beyond_again" }
